      "readme": {
        "en": "Bring your Silent Gliss SG Control A curtains into your daily routines. Learn Open, Stop and Close from your already paired remote, then use Homey controls and Flows without an additional gateway. Requires Homey Pro with 433 MHz radio. Each channel or group is learned separately. No physical position feedback. Independent community app, not affiliated with or endorsed by Silent Gliss. Developed by GPT-6 Astra.\n\nField-tested by one user with SG10949 and an SG5100 curtain system on Homey Pro (2026), firmware 13.5.1, using app 0.2.0: learning, Open, Stop during movement and Close. Version 0.3.1 has software checks only; no new hardware test. Other models, groups, radio range, long-term reliability and real Flow execution have not been verified. Control L, Control R and Move gateways are unsupported. Provided as is, without warranty of compatibility or reliable operation. To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, the developer and contributors accept no liability for loss or damage arising from use. Verify operation in your own installation before relying on automation.\n"
      },
